        "label": "Yves Klein in 1962",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He called them Zones of Immaterial Pictorial Sensibility.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "A grand name",
        "cut": "pear"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Buyers paid for each zone in gold.",
