        "stone": "diamond",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Paid in gold",
        "cut": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One zone sold for 20 grams of gold.",
      "say": "One zone sold for twenty grams of gold.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "20 grams",
        "sub": "One zone",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "citrine",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Each buyer got a signed receipt that looked like a banker's check.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "amethyst",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "A signed receipt",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "To really own the zone, the buyer had to burn the receipt.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "stone",
        "stone": "topaz",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "Burn the receipt",
        "cut": "emerald"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then Klein threw half of the gold into the Seine.",
      "say": "Then Klein threw half of the gold into the Sen.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "608-yves-klein-sold-empty-space-1.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "A view along the Seine",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The ritual needed a museum director and at least two witnesses.",
